--- !u!114 &2241831942060835345
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5874470078363554693}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  dialog:
  - text: Okay, what am I thinking?
    name: Torch
    character: {fileID: 1448012937513763991}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Dissapointed
  - text: 'You''re thinking... about me...

      thinking about you...

      thinking
      about...'
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1809109950}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Confused
  - text: 'You are absolutely crap at this...

      Do you even take anything seriously?'
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1448012937513763991}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Blank
  - text: 'I''m a little distracted man, what with all the KIDNAPPING...

      and
      MIND VOODOO

      Like what in the absolute freaking--'
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1809109950}
    pose: Meditating
    cameraAngle: 13
    face: Angry
  - text: You and Storm have been acting funny since Jack arrived in this town, you've
      been running around like ninja assassins doing who-knows-what, and Storm almost
      killed him?? Spartan Jack is my friend, you know. This isn't right.
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1809109950}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Mad
  - text: 'Look, I couldn''t have guessed Storm would act up this way, but she was
      right about one thing...

      We couldn''t have let Spartan Jack into the
      dojo'
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1448012937513763991}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Dissapointed
  - text: 'Why was Spartan Jack even going to the dojo at midnight???

      Why
      were you and Storm there????

      W-- Who-- wh-- how the---'
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1809109950}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: I DON'T UNDERSTAAAAAAND
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1809109950}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 6
    face: Mad
  - text: 'Wow that was... quite a scream...

      But I can''t tell you any more.

      I''ve,
      like, kind of let you in on too much already'
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1448012937513763991}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: 'Here I go again, me and my loose lips...

      I shouldn''t have woken
      you up in the first place'
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1448012937513763991}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: 'All this, and you''re really not gonna tell me anything?

      Ice cold,
      man...

      Ice frickin'' cold'
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1809109950}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Angry
  - text: 'The coolest.

      Naturally.'
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1448012937513763991}
    pose: Sassy
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: (She's so annoying... You start to dream up some wild situation with you
      and her kidnapped by Storm, staring death in the face, and she looks to you
      and shares her secrets in a moment of need... before you obviously break out
      of the shackles and save her because no rope is a match for this rockin' bod)
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 1809109950}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Happy
  - text: Maybe one day we'll be stuck with each other again in a life-or-death situation
      and I'll have to teach you everything I know in order to save us all...
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1448012937513763991}
    pose: Sassy
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: H... How did you...
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1809109950}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: 'Until then, fat chance, bozo.

      You''re on a need-to-know basis.
      You''re the muscle of this operation and I''m the brains.'
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1448012937513763991}
    pose: Sassy
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: (At least she got one thing right)
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 1809109950}
    pose: Sassy
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: 'Well, if you''re not gonna tell me any of the secrets CLAWING at my conscience,
      I might as well hit the hay.

      This day has given me a headache.'
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1809109950}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Angry
  - text: Sweet dreams, ya big idiot
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1448012937513763991}
    pose: Sassy
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: You better not invade my mind this time, you little freak
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1809109950}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  turnToFace: 1
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
