--- !u!114 &7624025255791560608
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5874470078363554693}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c530a24ea0ef8d34990d94afbefe7c3f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  dialog:
  - Day 3 (Thad) - Holy cow. The holiest of cows. I must have drank from the divine
    utter because what even happened, man
  - I knew Storm was intense, but admitting to taking my new friend hostage? Almost
    killing him? What could possibly be worth all that trouble?
  - I know, deep down in my heart of hearts, that whatever is hidden in that dojo
    is gonna be positively flippin' metal
  - I am a man on a mission now. A juggernaut. No one gets in the way of these guns
    and lives to tell the tale.
  - Except maybe Stretch. She's in my way all the time. And I can't even tell if
    she's a friend or foe
  - 'Better keep a close eye on her... like the one she''s keeping on me. And sleeping
    in my house? I don''t have the brainpower for this '
--- !u!114 &7624025255791560609
